221	// fetchCrossRepoCheckpoint fetches cid's per-checkpoint ref
222	// (refs/entire/checkpoints/<shard>/<id>) from url into a fresh temp repo and
223	// returns an explain lookup over that repo, plus a cleanup that deletes it.
224	// Separated from URL resolution so tests can exercise the fetch + explain
225	// flow against a file:// remote without the core API or git-remote-entire.
